Package: rsetcover
Type: Package
Title: R bindings for the setcover Rust core
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Matthias", "Kaeding", email = "kaedingmatthias@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
)
Description: Provides a thin R interface to the Rust implementations of the greedy set cover
    algorithms from the 'setcover-core' crate. Lists of integer vectors or long-form data frames
    can be passed directly from R, and the selected set identifiers are returned as character vectors.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: Rust (>= 1.70)
LinkingTo: extendr
Imports:
    stats
